{
  "info": {
    "name": "Falabella D&K — Validación de firma",
    "description": "Sirve para probar la firma HMAC contra la API real de Falabella sin tocar el código Java. Ojo: Falabella no tiene ambiente de pruebas, todo es producción, así que acá solo hay requests de lectura (Get*).\n\nCómo usarla:\n1. Importa también el environment 'Falabella D&K' y completa userId / apiKey / sellerId.\n2. Corre los requests en orden.\n3. Si te devuelven SuccessResponse con datos, la firma está funcionando.\n4. Si sale E007 (la firma no calza), revisa el encode del timestamp: los ':' tienen que ir como %3A.\n\nNota: GetMetrics puede responder E077 ('no metrics data') según la cuenta. Eso es de la cuenta, no de la firma.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const CryptoJS = require('crypto-js');",
          "",
          "const userId = pm.environment.get('userId');",
          "const apiKey = pm.environment.get('apiKey');",
          "",
          "// Timestamp ISO 8601 con hora LOCAL y timezone local.",
          "// (No usar toISOString(): devuelve hora UTC y al pegarle el offset",
          "//  local quedaría un instante desplazado en horas.)",
          "const now = new Date();",
          "const offsetMin = now.getTimezoneOffset();",
          "const sign = offsetMin <= 0 ? '+' : '-';",
          "const pad = (n) => String(n).padStart(2, '0');",
          "const tz = `${sign}${pad(Math.floor(Math.abs(offsetMin) / 60))}:${pad(Math.abs(offsetMin) % 60)}`;",
          "const timestamp = `${now.getFullYear()}-${pad(now.getMonth() + 1)}-${pad(now.getDate())}` +",
          "    `T${pad(now.getHours())}:${pad(now.getMinutes())}:${pad(now.getSeconds())}` + tz;",
          "",
          "// Parámetros base + extras del request (sin Signature)",
          "const params = {",
          "    Action: pm.request.url.query.get('Action'),",
          "    Format: 'JSON',",
          "    Timestamp: timestamp,",
          "    UserID: userId,",
          "    Version: '1.0'",
          "};",
          "pm.request.url.query.each(q => {",
          "    if (q.key !== 'Signature' && !params[q.key] && q.value && !q.value.startsWith('{{')) {",
          "        params[q.key] = q.value;",
          "    }",
          "});",
          "",
          "// Ordenar + encode + concatenar + firmar (HMAC-SHA256 hex lowercase)",
          "const stringToSign = Object.keys(params).sort()",
          "    .map(k => encodeURIComponent(k) + '=' + encodeURIComponent(params[k]))",
          "    .join('&');",
          "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(stringToSign, apiKey).toString();",
          "",
          "// Guardar para diagnóstico (NUNCA registrar la apiKey)",
          "console.log('stringToSign:', stringToSign);",
          "",
          "pm.variables.set('timestamp', encodeURIComponent(timestamp));",
          "pm.variables.set('signature', signature);",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({",
          "    key: 'User-Agent',",
          "    value: pm.environment.get('sellerId') + '/Postman/Test'",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
          "",
          "pm.test('SuccessResponse presente (sin ErrorResponse)', () => {",
          "    const json = pm.response.json();",
          "    if (json.ErrorResponse) {",
          "        const head = json.ErrorResponse.Head || {};",
          "        throw new Error(head.ErrorCode + ': ' + head.ErrorMessage);",
          "    }",
          "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('SuccessResponse');",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. GetMetrics (alltime)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/?Action=GetMetrics&Format=JSON&Timestamp={{timestamp}}&UserID={{userId}}&Version=1.0&Signature={{signature}}&StatisticsType=alltime",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": [""],
          "query": [
            { "key": "Action", "value": "GetMetrics" },
            { "key": "Format", "value": "JSON" },
            { "key": "Timestamp", "value": "{{timestamp}}" },
            { "key": "UserID", "value": "{{userId}}" },
            { "key": "Version", "value": "1.0" },
            { "key": "Signature", "value": "{{signature}}" },
            { "key": "StatisticsType", "value": "alltime" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Primera prueba. Si devuelve SuccessResponse, la firma anda. Esta cuenta en particular responde E077 ('no hay datos de métricas'): no es error de firma, es que la cuenta no tiene métricas cargadas."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. GetCategoryTree",
